<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - NCR Corp started as hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - NCR Corp started as hold.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salomon Brothers Inc said it initiated coverage of NCR Corp as a hold.</p>
<p>-- Using normalized tax rate of 37.5 percent, Salomon expects NCR to earn $1.62 a share in 1997 and $2.20 a share in 1998.</p>
<p>-- Said NCR has potential to continue to improve operating margins and earnings, but cautioned that the industry is now &quot;significantly more competitive.&quot;</p>
<p>-- NCR lost 5/8 to 29-1/2.</p>
</text>
